      "writtenOn": "2021-07-10T21:56:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we need to explain *why* we\u0027re doing this here.\n\nie. that payload data packet may have gone through non-offload path, before we added offload rules, and that this may result in in-kernel conntrack state being in ESTABLISHED but pending ACK (ie. UNACKED) state.\n\nBut the in kernel conntrack might never see the ACK because we just added offload rules.\n\nAs such after adding the rules we need to force the timeout back to the normal ESTABLISHED timeout of 5 days.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1617,
        "startChar": 0,
